      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, “Oshube ogye ogonze omumalaya aina omugenda. Omugonze nk'okwo nkyagonza Abaisiraeli, n'orwo balikugonza baruhanga abandi, nibahongera n'ebihuuku ezabibu zomire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo omukazi ogwo nkamugaruza esarafu 15 z'efeza n'ekilo 150 z'eshayiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namugambira nti, “Noragirwa kundeka eibanga lirai otateire bumalaya anga kusiyana; nanye ndakuleka ntyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Abaisiraeli balimara ebiro bingi bataina mukama anga mutwazi, tibalitamba bitambo anga kugira nyomyo ntakatifu ey'amabare. N'efodi na terafimu tibalibigira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma balihinduka bagaruke aha Mukama Ruhanga wabo na mwijukuru",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mwijukuru wa Daudi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Masiha, omuchunguzi alitabuka omu ruganda rwa Daudi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa Daudi omukama wabo. Makiro aga nyuma ago balitina Omukama batungwe n'ebirungibye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "N'ebirungibye",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bagarulirwe endimiro zabo n'emizabibu n'emitini.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
